Description: Ollama-compatible API server for Hailo AI accelerators
 The Hailo Model Zoo GenAI is a curated collection of pre-trained models
 and example applications optimized for Hailo's AI processors, designed
 to accelerate GenAI application development.
 .
 This package contains Hailo-Ollama, an Ollama-compatible REST API
 server written in C++ on top of HailoRT, enabling seamless integration
 with tools and frameworks that speak Ollama's API.
 .
 Models are fetched on demand at runtime and are not included in this
 package.
